  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Compact robust flightless bird, reduced paired forelimbs/wings and stout walking legs. Not fossil skull-only, modern chicken copy or flying bird. [\"Near-complete MACN-N11 skeleton still has missing anterior skull and other regions; holotypeMACN-N03 more fragmentary.\", \"Feathers, bill-tip, soft body volume and pose inferred.\", \"Do not present black/unpreserved areas of a reconstruction as direct fossil evidence.\", \"No exact tooth claim from unpreserved bill tip; closed conservative bill.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"model_standing_height_m\": 0.4, \"height_status\": \"Reconstruction choice, not measured complete live height.\", \"MACN_N11_humerus_m\": 0.0598, \"MACN_N11_tarsometatarsus_m\": 0.0508, \"MACN_N11_femur_preserved_m\": 0.0991, \"MACN_N11_tibiotarsus_preserved_m\": 0.1362, \"measurement_note\": \"Chiappe2002Tables3/5. Femur and tibiotarsus incomplete: original > values; actual less than3mm longer per table footnote. Do not report preserved values as complete exact lengths.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Compact robust flightless bird, reduced paired forelimbs/wings and stout walking legs. Not fossil skull-only, modern chicken copy or flying bird. [\"Near-complete MACN-N11 skeleton still has missing anterior skull and other regions; holotypeMACN-N03 more fragmentary.\", \"Feathers, bill-tip, soft body volume and pose inferred.\", \"Do not present black/unpreserved areas of a reconstruction as direct fossil evidence.\", \"No exact tooth claim from unpreserved bill tip; closed conservative bill.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"model_standing_height_m\": 0.4, \"height_status\": \"Reconstruction choice, not measured complete live height.\", \"MACN_N11_humerus_m\": 0.0598, \"MACN_N11_tarsometatarsus_m\": 0.0508, \"MACN_N11_femur_preserved_m\": 0.0991, \"MACN_N11_tibiotarsus_preserved_m\": 0.1362, \"measurement_note\": \"Chiappe2002Tables3/5. Femur and tibiotarsus incomplete: original > values; actual less than3mm longer per table footnote. Do not report preserved values as complete exact lengths.\"}"
  },
